{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10713","headline":"後出塞五首 五 · 杜甫","name":"後出塞五首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我本良家子，出师亦多门。\n将骄益愁思，身贵不足论。\n跃马二十年，恐辜明主恩。\n坐见幽州骑，长驱河洛昏。\n中夜间道归，故里但空邨。\n恶名幸脱免，穷老无儿孙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10713.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10713","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}